  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEMESTA Programme Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component is to support the delivery of SEMESTA Programme ie. the Forest, Agriculture and Sustainable Trade (FAST) component and the Critical Minerals Management for Sustainability (MAKMUR) component. This component will provide a crucial role in ensuring the programme is effectively and efficiently implemented and monitored, to maintain accountability and transparency of the use of ODA fund channelled through the SEMESTA programme.</narrative>
  </description>
